 resilience and this is a space where we honor that and remember that cultural memory is carried through our sounds and our voices and our storytelling and yeah we're gonna be listening to the beautiful soulful barbara manson bedroom gems for lady love this is a very sweet and sensual all about love episode because I love love and love is what keeps us together and reminds us of the beauty of everything around us and it's just beautiful to love just beautiful to let yourself feel something so strongly and show people that love as well and I just also just love listening to people sing about love and how love makes them feel um but yeah this is a very this is so freaking scorpio mercury retrograde of just like i don't know obsessing over just love not obsessing but like adoring intensely um but yes no this is a very beautiful segment very very beautiful episode this is literally the pioneer of philly's soul the queen the mother and yeah we're gonna be listening to some of her songs maybe i'll have a little bit of talking in between but then i think barbara is gonna speak for me with the love this is fbr radio 94.5 and this is a two and this is barbara manson"}, {"start": "00:34:51", "end": "00:35:13", "text": "But we gotta play the next song, because From His Woman to You is one song that I'm like, no, no, no secondary to love. We are love. We will not settle or be second to anyone. So, sorry, Miss Girl. But this is Annie Love."}, {"start": "00:53:14", "end": "00:54:55", "text": "We're coming to an end of today's beautiful episode, Bedroom Gems from Lady Love, dedicated to the pioneer of Philly soul, Barbara Mason. This is Rhythmic Resistance on FBi Radio 94.5. point five i'll see you guys next week but i just wanted to sign off and yeah just keep loving that's today's episode love love entirely love with your whole heart and don't be scared to to be in love and to just to love people as well never lose when you're in love or when you have love but also remember that love exists within you it's not just what you see around you and yes there's beauty in everything you see we are love and we have to remember that wherever we go to always carry that love and yeah anything that you love is a reflection of yourself so always remember that you know love starts with you but yeah this is rhythmic resistance 94.5 fm and i'll see you again next week bye"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:03:50"}, "track": {"title": "I'm In Love With You", "artists": [{"name": "Barbara Mason"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:25:23"}, "track": {"title": "Yes, I'm Ready", "artists": [{"name": "Barbara Mason"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:39:00"}, "track": {"title": "She's Got the Papers (I Got the Man)", "artists": [{"name": "Barbara Mason"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:54:00"}, "track": {"title": "If This World Were Mine", "artists": [{"name": "Barbara Mason"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:58:00"}, "track": {"title": "Come See About Me", "artists": [{"name": "Nella Dodds"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}]}